WEBVTT

00:01.025 --> 00:03.922
<i>["Deck the Halls" playing]</i>
<i>[播放“Deck the Halls”]</i>

00:03.991 --> 00:10.956
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:13.611 --> 00:14.715
Ta da!
哒哒！

00:14.784 --> 00:17.991
This gift is for Santa Claus.
这份礼物是送给圣诞老人的。

00:18.059 --> 00:20.715
Even Santa deserves
a gift, right Gary?
即使是圣诞老人也值得
一份礼物，对吧加里？

00:20.784 --> 00:22.404
[meows]
[喵喵]

00:22.473 --> 00:24.335
♪ Santa Claus, Santa Claus ♪
♪ 圣诞老人，圣诞老人 ♪

00:24.404 --> 00:26.059
♪ Santa's on his way ♪
♪ 圣诞老人正在赶来的路上 ♪

00:26.128 --> 00:27.680
♪ I'm giving him a present ♪
♪ 我要送他一份礼物 ♪

00:27.749 --> 00:29.335
♪ That he'll take back
on his sleigh ♪
♪ 他会收回的
在他的雪橇上♪

00:29.404 --> 00:31.853
<i>Yay! [vocalizing]</i>
耶！ [发声]</i>

00:31.922 --> 00:34.887
Ho, ho, ho!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

00:42.301 --> 00:44.404
Hmm...
唔...

00:49.163 --> 00:51.266
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

00:54.163 --> 00:56.232
Oh, yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

00:56.301 --> 00:59.784
Ho, ho, ho, shrink-o.
嗬，嗬，嗬，收缩-o。

01:04.542 --> 01:09.646
[vocalizing "Jingle Bells"]
[发出“铃儿响叮当”的声音]

01:20.784 --> 01:24.266
Ho, ho, ho!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

01:24.784 --> 01:26.922
narrator: Seven months later.
旁白：七个月后。

01:29.542 --> 01:32.266
Excuse me, Mr. Sofa.
对不起，沙发先生。

01:32.335 --> 01:33.680
Ha, look at that, Gary.
哈，看看那个，加里。

01:33.749 --> 01:35.956
It's the present I left
for Santa last Christmas.
这是我留下的礼物
去年圣诞节给圣诞老人。

01:36.025 --> 01:38.439
Isn't that nice?
这不是很好吗？

01:38.508 --> 01:42.404
The present I left for Santa
last Christmas!
我留给圣诞老人的礼物
去年圣诞节！

01:42.473 --> 01:44.163
He never got it.
他从来没有得到过。

01:44.232 --> 01:47.370
Oh, this is the worst disaster
that's ever happened.
噢，这是最严重的灾难
这种事曾经发生过。

01:47.439 --> 01:51.473
My present to Santa
is 212 days late.
我给圣诞老人的礼物
晚了212天。

01:53.611 --> 01:58.508
Late, it's a tragedy.
来晚了，悲剧了。

01:58.577 --> 02:03.335
My joyful carefree world
is growing dark and dreary.
我的快乐无忧无虑的世界
天色越来越暗，越来越沉闷。

02:03.404 --> 02:06.956
I can't go on.
我无法继续下去了。

02:07.025 --> 02:10.025
No, I'll go on.
不，我会继续。

02:10.094 --> 02:13.232
But I can't go on!
但我不能继续下去了！

02:13.301 --> 02:15.232
Whoo-hoo! [whistles]
呼呼！ [口哨声]

02:15.301 --> 02:18.473
Whoo-hoo! Five stars.
呼呼！五颗星。

02:18.542 --> 02:20.059
Patrick, I wasn't acting.
帕特里克，我没有演戏。

02:20.128 --> 02:22.715
Santa never got
his Christmas present.
圣诞老人从未得到过
他的圣诞礼物。

02:22.784 --> 02:25.680
So why not just
deliver it to him?
那么为什么不只是
送给他？

02:27.335 --> 02:29.301
Why not just deliver it to him?
为什么不直接送给他呢？

02:29.370 --> 02:31.956
[chuckles]
That's a dumb idea.
[笑声]
这是一个愚蠢的想法。

02:32.025 --> 02:33.611
I'm in!
- Great!
我进来了！
- 伟大的！

02:33.680 --> 02:38.508
But how will we get there?
We can't walk that far.
但我们怎样才能到达那里呢？
我们走不了那么远。

02:38.577 --> 02:41.991
Oh, we can push
and shove each other.
哦，我们可以推动
并互相推搡。

02:42.059 --> 02:43.197
Great idea!
好主意！

02:43.266 --> 02:47.059
We can't let it be
one more day late.
我们不能让它这样
又晚了一天。

02:47.128 --> 02:49.439
Okay, me first.
好吧，我先。

02:49.508 --> 02:52.991
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:53.059 --> 02:55.577
My turn!
轮到我了！

02:58.473 --> 03:01.197
- What the...
- Merry Christmas.
- 什么...
- 圣诞快乐。

03:01.266 --> 03:04.404
Um, it's July?
嗯，现在是七月吗？

03:04.473 --> 03:07.508
Ah, it's a good day to be bad.
啊，今天是坏事的好日子。

03:10.128 --> 03:13.611
[laughing]
[笑]

03:15.818 --> 03:17.266
[laughs]
[笑]

03:17.335 --> 03:20.784
Uh, SpongeBob?
You got a booger.
呃，海绵宝宝？
你有鼻屎。

03:20.853 --> 03:22.473
Oh!
哦！

03:22.542 --> 03:26.197
Don't worry,
that's what friends are for.
别担心，
这就是朋友的目的。

03:26.266 --> 03:27.784
Blow.
吹。

03:30.163 --> 03:32.163
Thank you.
谢谢。

03:32.232 --> 03:33.473
Eww!
哇！

03:33.542 --> 03:37.784
It's the ugliest booger
I've ever seen.
这是最丑的鼻屎
我曾经见过。

03:37.853 --> 03:40.991
Can't you screwballs
walk without falling?
你不能搞鬼吗
走路不摔倒？

03:41.059 --> 03:42.197
Sorry Plankton.
对不起，浮游生物。

03:42.266 --> 03:43.715
We're pushing
and shoving ourselves
我们正在推动
并推挤我们自己

03:43.784 --> 03:45.128
all the way to the North Pole.
一直到北极。

03:45.197 --> 03:48.232
I have to give Santa
his Christmas present.
我必须给圣诞老人
他的圣诞礼物。

03:48.301 --> 03:50.853
Santa? I hate that guy.
圣诞老人？我讨厌那个家伙。

03:50.922 --> 03:54.301
He's had me on a naughty list
ever since I got this tattoo.
他把我列入了淘气名单
自从我有了这个纹身。

03:54.370 --> 03:57.059
both: Born to be naughty?
两人：天生顽皮？

03:57.128 --> 03:59.301
Whoo! Wait a minute.
呼！等一下。

03:59.370 --> 04:01.577
If I can
break into Santa's lair,
如果我可以的话
闯入圣诞老人的巢穴，

04:01.646 --> 04:03.577
hack his mainframe,
change my status
破解他的主机，
改变我的状态

04:03.646 --> 04:04.991
from naughty to nice,
从调皮到乖巧，

04:05.059 --> 04:08.508
I could ask for
the Krabby Patty secret formula
我可以要求
蟹黄派的秘密配方

04:08.577 --> 04:11.508
and he'd have to give it to me.
他必须把它给我。

04:11.577 --> 04:12.887
I'm coming with you.
我跟你一起去。

04:12.956 --> 04:15.473
- Pushed or shoved?
- Shrimp that!
- 推还是推？
- 虾那个！

04:15.542 --> 04:20.128
We are going in style, babies.
我们将以时尚的方式出发，宝贝们。

04:20.197 --> 04:23.335
[engine rumbling]
[发动机轰鸣]

04:23.404 --> 04:26.542
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

04:26.611 --> 04:28.818
I built it to fly
and run over bodies
我建造它是为了飞翔
并碾过尸体

04:28.887 --> 04:30.749
during the zombie apocalypse,
在僵尸大灾难期间，

04:30.818 --> 04:32.542
but it'll work on snow too.
但它也适用于雪。

04:33.887 --> 04:36.577
We'll take the Pacific
to the Arctic,
我们将占领太平洋
到北极，

04:36.646 --> 04:40.094
then over ice and snow
to the North Pole.
然后越过冰雪
到北极。

04:40.163 --> 04:43.680
Easy-peasy, Santa-squeezy.
[chuckles]
轻松，圣诞老人。
[笑声]

04:43.749 --> 04:47.508
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

04:47.577 --> 04:49.611
Seat belts.
安全带。

04:49.680 --> 04:52.301
Of course, safety first.
当然，安全第一。

04:52.370 --> 04:55.197
All secured, Captain Plankton.
一切都安全了，浮游生物船长。

04:58.232 --> 04:59.749
All secured.
全部安全。

04:59.818 --> 05:03.163
[groans] I'm already
regretting this trip.
[呻吟]我已经
后悔这次旅行。

05:08.680 --> 05:10.715
- Whee! [laughs]
- Ya-hoo!
- 呼！ [笑]
- 雅虎！

05:10.784 --> 05:12.163
[vocalizing]
[发声]

05:12.232 --> 05:14.128
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:18.680 --> 05:23.232
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:23.301 --> 05:25.232
We did it!
我们做到了！

05:25.301 --> 05:28.232
Oh, look at those
tiny little fish.
哦，看看那些
小鱼。

05:28.301 --> 05:29.749
both: Hi.
两人：嗨。

05:29.818 --> 05:32.301
Hey, get back to your seats!
嘿，回到座位上吧！

05:32.370 --> 05:34.922
The seat belt sign is off.
安全带指示灯熄灭。

05:36.266 --> 05:37.922
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:37.991 --> 05:39.266
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:39.335 --> 05:41.301
The visitors, they're here!
访客，他们来了！

05:41.370 --> 05:43.542
He seemed happy to see us.
他似乎很高兴见到我们。

05:43.611 --> 05:46.715
Oh!
哦！

05:46.784 --> 05:49.577
Ah!
- Whoa, a flying lawn chair.
啊!
- 哇，一把会飞的草坪椅。

06:02.094 --> 06:04.232
- Hey!
- Give me that.
- 嘿！
- 给我那个。

06:04.301 --> 06:07.749
What's in this box anyway?
- It's a surprise.
这个盒子里到底装着什么？
- 这是一个惊喜。

06:10.956 --> 06:12.473
I hope it's a stink bomb
我希望这是一颗臭弹

06:12.542 --> 06:15.025
for that
pot-bellied jingle joker.
为此
大腹便便的小丑。

06:15.094 --> 06:17.232
Santa is not pot-bellied.
圣诞老人可不是大腹便便的。

06:17.301 --> 06:19.473
He just suffers
from seasonal bloating.
他只是受苦
来自季节性腹胀。

06:19.542 --> 06:21.266
Right.
正确的。

06:21.335 --> 06:22.680
I'm going to sleep.
我要去睡觉。

06:22.749 --> 06:24.611
But who will fly this thing?
但谁会驾驶这个东西呢？

06:24.680 --> 06:26.956
I put it on automatic pilot.
我把它调到自动驾驶仪上。

06:27.025 --> 06:29.853
You and that pink moron
can sleep on the floor.
你和那个粉红白痴
可以睡在地板上。

06:36.715 --> 06:37.853
[claps]
[鼓掌]

06:43.301 --> 06:47.128
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:47.197 --> 06:49.680
Hey, what are you
imbeciles doing?
嘿，你是什么
蠢货在做什么？

06:49.749 --> 06:51.715
We found the North Pole.
我们找到了北极。

06:51.784 --> 06:53.646
It was way closer than you said.
比你说的要近得多。

06:53.715 --> 06:55.301
North Pole?
北极？

06:55.370 --> 06:56.853
Impossible.
不可能的。

06:56.922 --> 06:58.818
How long was I asleep?
我睡了多久？

06:58.887 --> 07:01.611
Funny how the ground
keeps getting closer.
有趣的是地面如何
越来越近。

07:05.542 --> 07:08.611
<i>Welcome to
Christmas Land Theme Park.</i>
欢迎来到
圣诞乐园主题公园。</i>

07:08.680 --> 07:11.128
<i>Where every day is Christmas.</i>
<i>每天都是圣诞节。</i>

07:13.715 --> 07:16.439
Hey, get out of my seat.
嘿，离开我的座位。

07:16.508 --> 07:18.680
[dinging]
[叮叮]

07:18.749 --> 07:22.232
The seat belt sign is on.
安全带标志亮起。

07:25.784 --> 07:29.094
Cabin crew, prepare for landing.
机组人员，准备着陆。

07:29.163 --> 07:31.680
Do you actually
know how to land?
你实际上吗
知道如何着陆吗？

07:31.749 --> 07:34.991
I know how to crash land.
我知道如何迫降。

07:39.301 --> 07:42.335
My seat belt!
我的安全带！

07:52.508 --> 07:54.439
both: The North Pole!
两者：北极！

07:54.508 --> 07:57.094
We made it!
我们成功了！

07:57.163 --> 08:00.266
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:03.266 --> 08:08.094
Huh? Look what you two
broken brain buffoons did!
啊？看看你们两个
脑子坏了的小丑干的！

08:08.163 --> 08:11.335
You completely destroyed
the navigation system.
你彻底摧毁了
导航系统。

08:11.404 --> 08:12.508
You're welcome.
不客气。

08:12.577 --> 08:14.749
Don't be mad, Plankton.
We're here.
别生气，浮游生物。
我们到了。

08:17.922 --> 08:20.301
Look at all this.
看看这一切。

08:20.370 --> 08:23.611
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

08:23.680 --> 08:24.611
Hmm.
唔。

08:24.680 --> 08:26.301
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

08:26.370 --> 08:29.370
Ooh, Santa's elves.
哦，圣诞老人的精灵们。

08:29.439 --> 08:33.059
[both gasp]
- Santa's reindeer!
[两人都喘气]
- 圣诞老人的驯鹿！

08:34.404 --> 08:37.335
both: This is amazing!
两人：这太棒了！

08:37.404 --> 08:39.370
Something's wrong here.
这里出了点问题。

08:39.439 --> 08:42.404
It isn't even cold.
And look at this smog.
甚至不冷。
看看这烟雾。

08:43.853 --> 08:47.956
- It's snow and smog?
- It's "snog."
- 有雪和烟雾吗？
- 这是“接吻”。

08:48.025 --> 08:51.128
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

08:51.197 --> 08:53.059
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:53.128 --> 08:55.473
Santa's workshop!
圣诞老人的工作坊！

08:55.542 --> 08:57.922
all: ♪ Making toys,
work, work, work ♪
全部：♪ 制作玩具，
工作、工作、工作♪

08:57.991 --> 09:00.680
♪ Making toys,
work, work, work ♪
♪ 制作玩具，
工作、工作、工作♪

09:00.749 --> 09:04.370
Hello, Santa's elves,
I'm SpongeBob. Merry Christmas.
你好，圣诞老人的小精灵们，
我是海绵宝宝。圣诞快乐。

09:04.439 --> 09:10.611
[voice distorted]
Make, work... make, work...
[声音扭曲]
制作，工作...制作，工作...

09:10.680 --> 09:14.439
Looks like Santa's
gone all in for automation.
看起来像圣诞老人
全力以赴实现自动化。

09:14.508 --> 09:16.335
Hey guys, look.
嘿伙计们，看。

09:16.404 --> 09:21.163
It says, [gasps]
"meet Santa Claus!"
它说，[喘气]
“来见见圣诞老人吧！”

09:21.232 --> 09:24.818
Come on, guys! [giggles]
- Let's meet Santa!
来吧，伙计们！ [咯咯笑]
- 让我们来见见圣诞老人吧！

09:24.887 --> 09:28.232
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

09:28.301 --> 09:30.784
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:30.853 --> 09:35.542
We're finally here,
little present.
我们终于来了，
小礼物。

09:35.611 --> 09:39.404
Guys, I hate to say this,
but this place is a sham.
伙计们，我讨厌这样说，
但这个地方是一个骗局。

09:39.473 --> 09:42.128
I don't know why,
but we're being tricked.
我不知道为什么，
但我们被欺骗了。

09:42.197 --> 09:45.853
Oh, Plankton,
Christmas is about believing.
哦，浮游生物，
圣诞节是关于相信的。

09:45.922 --> 09:50.163
Yeah, Christmas
is about bleeding, man.
是的，圣诞节
是关于流血的，伙计。

09:51.956 --> 09:53.784
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

09:53.853 --> 09:58.163
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:00.542 --> 10:05.163
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

10:05.232 --> 10:08.404
I wouldn't believe it if I
didn't see it with my own eye.
我不会相信如果我
没有亲眼所见。

10:08.473 --> 10:11.991
The bearded weirdo in the flesh.
肉体中的大胡子怪人。

10:16.784 --> 10:19.922
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

10:19.991 --> 10:22.025
What would you like
for Christmas?
你想要什么
圣诞节？

10:22.094 --> 10:27.715
[both speaking at once]
[两人同时发言]

10:27.784 --> 10:29.404
Pipe down, children.
放下心来，孩子们。

10:34.266 --> 10:36.818
What the...
什么...

10:36.887 --> 10:37.956
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:38.025 --> 10:41.404
SpongeBob SquarePants?
海绵宝宝？

10:41.473 --> 10:42.991
Hi, Santa.
嗨，圣诞老人。

10:43.059 --> 10:46.266
Did you know
that I'm your biggest fan?
你知道吗
我是你最大的粉丝？

10:46.335 --> 10:48.335
Oh, that's very sweet
of you Santa
哦，这很甜蜜
你圣诞老人

10:48.404 --> 10:51.439
but actually Patchy the Pirate
is my biggest fan.
但实际上海盗帕奇
是我最大的粉丝。

10:51.508 --> 10:52.956
Ho, ho, ho!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

10:53.025 --> 10:55.508
Ahoy, SpongeBob and Patrick!
嘿，海绵宝宝和帕特里克！

10:55.577 --> 10:57.818
It's me, Patchy the Pirate.
是我，海盗帕奇。

11:04.197 --> 11:05.680
Patchy the Pirate?
海盗帕奇？

11:05.749 --> 11:07.301
You're Santa?
你是圣诞老人吗？

11:07.370 --> 11:10.922
No, I just play Santa here
in Christmas Land Theme Park.
不，我只是在这里扮演圣诞老人
在圣诞乐园主题公园。

11:10.991 --> 11:13.197
It's me side-hustle.
这是我的副业。

11:13.266 --> 11:15.853
I knew this wasn't
the North Pole.
我知道这不是
北极。

11:15.922 --> 11:19.542
North Pole?
No, man, this be Encino.
北极？
不，伙计，这是恩西诺。

11:19.611 --> 11:23.266
You're almost 4,000 miles
from the North Pole.
您已行驶近 4,000 英里
来自北极。

11:23.335 --> 11:25.197
[growls]
[咆哮]

11:25.266 --> 11:28.749
I'm gonna destroy you two!
我要毁了你们两个！

11:28.818 --> 11:30.991
4,000 miles?
4,000 英里？

11:31.059 --> 11:33.542
Oh, if only our GPS
wasn't busted.
哦，如果只有我们的 GPS 就好了
没有被抓。

11:33.611 --> 11:36.404
Ooh, I can help
with global positioning.
哦，我可以帮忙
具有全球定位。

11:36.473 --> 11:38.301
Way before GPS,
远早于 GPS，

11:38.370 --> 11:41.473
pirates used
these things called maps.
海盗使用
这些东西叫做地图。

11:43.991 --> 11:45.784
Oh, and you'll need
a compass too.
哦，你需要
还有指南针。

11:45.853 --> 11:48.335
[squawks] Happy holidays.
[尖叫]节日快乐。

11:49.335 --> 11:52.646
[grunts]
[both laugh]
[咕哝]
[两人都笑了]

11:52.715 --> 11:54.611
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:54.680 --> 11:56.784
Polly want a smacker?
波莉想要一个咂嘴吗？

11:56.853 --> 11:59.266
Well, thanks, Patchy.
Guess we'll be on our way.
好吧，谢谢，帕奇。
猜猜我们会上路的。

12:03.266 --> 12:05.232
Goodbye! Good luck.
再见！祝你好运。

12:05.301 --> 12:07.956
If you see Santy Claus,
tell him I want a new parrot.
如果你看到圣诞老人，
告诉他我想要一只新鹦鹉。

12:08.025 --> 12:09.197
- [squawks]
- Hey!
- [嘎嘎声]
- 嘿！

12:09.266 --> 12:13.715
- And I want a new pirate.
- Ow!
- 我想要一个新海盗。
- 噢！

12:13.784 --> 12:15.232
<i>Woah!</i>
<i>哇！</i>

12:17.715 --> 12:18.991
<i>Wait, where are we?</i>
<i>等等，我们在哪里？</i>

12:19.059 --> 12:20.922
<i>[all scream]</i>
<i>[全部尖叫]</i>

12:25.439 --> 12:28.128
<i>all: Whoa!</i>
<i>所有人：哇！</i>

12:31.370 --> 12:36.646
[shivering] S-S-Santa's
workshop, dead ahead.
[颤抖]S-S-圣诞老人的
车间，正前方。

12:36.715 --> 12:41.128
[shivering] J-j-just in time.
I'm f-f-freezing.
[发抖] J-J-来得正是时候。
我快冻僵了。

12:41.197 --> 12:42.991
Are we there yet?
我们到了吗？

12:50.439 --> 12:52.266
How you doing with
that Plankton pop?
你怎么样
浮游生物流行音乐？

12:52.335 --> 12:55.749
I can't wait to
get to the chewy middle.
我等不及了
到达有嚼劲的中间。

12:55.818 --> 12:58.542
[groaning]
[呻吟]

13:03.956 --> 13:06.094
Hey Patrick, where's Plankton?
嘿帕特里克，浮游生物在哪里？

13:06.163 --> 13:07.922
I don't know.
我不知道。

13:07.991 --> 13:10.853
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:10.922 --> 13:13.611
[groans]
[呻吟]

13:13.680 --> 13:17.094
Eat a breath mint, trench mouth.
吃一口薄荷，沟口。

13:17.163 --> 13:21.577
All right, here it goes.
好吧，就这样吧。

13:21.646 --> 13:23.956
Huh?
啊？

13:24.025 --> 13:26.991
Aw, you guys look great!
噢，你们看起来棒极了！

13:27.059 --> 13:29.646
I like your spaceman helmets.
我喜欢你的太空人头盔。

13:29.715 --> 13:32.370
But it's not Halloween
for another three months.
但这不是万圣节
再过三个月。

13:32.439 --> 13:36.611
We're not here for Halloween,
we're here for Santa.
我们不是来过万圣节的
我们是来迎接圣诞老人的。

13:36.680 --> 13:38.370
I've got my own agenda
我有自己的议程

13:38.439 --> 13:41.335
so this is
where we part company.
所以这是
我们分手的地方。

13:41.404 --> 13:45.335
Oh, sorry, Santa's not home.
哦，抱歉，圣诞老人不在家。

13:45.404 --> 13:47.853
He's in Aruba with the Missus.
他和太太在阿鲁巴岛。

13:47.922 --> 13:52.025
But... here you go anyway.
但是……无论如何，你还是走吧。

13:57.853 --> 13:58.853
But... but...
但是……但是……

13:58.887 --> 14:01.370
Happy Halloween!
万圣节快乐！

14:03.163 --> 14:06.025
<i>[upbeat rockabilly music]</i>
<i>[欢快的摇滚音乐]</i>

14:06.094 --> 14:11.197
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

14:11.266 --> 14:13.439
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

14:13.508 --> 14:16.128
[gasps]
[喘气]

14:16.197 --> 14:18.301
Ah! Eh, ah!
啊!诶诶诶！

14:21.542 --> 14:24.784
Hey, that's Plankton.
He's inside.
嘿，那是浮游生物。
他在里面。

14:24.853 --> 14:27.715
[knocking]
- Eh?
[敲门声]
- 呃？

14:27.784 --> 14:30.577
Bleh. Jeez.
布莱赫。天啊。

14:30.646 --> 14:33.715
I have to get
Santa's present under his tree.
我必须得到
圣诞老人的礼物在他的树下。

14:33.784 --> 14:35.646
We've got to get inside.
我们必须进去。

14:35.715 --> 14:38.715
Ah! I'm on it.
啊!我正在做。

14:38.784 --> 14:40.611
Hmm, I know!
嗯，我知道！

14:40.680 --> 14:43.991
We'll go in Santa style.
Down the chimney.
我们将以圣诞老人的方式去。
顺着烟囱下去。

14:44.059 --> 14:49.163
Oh, fine, we'll go
with your idea.
哦，好吧，我们这就走
与你的想法。

14:49.232 --> 14:52.163
Hmm, now where in Kris Kringle
嗯，现在在 Kris Kringle 的哪里

14:52.232 --> 14:54.853
is Santa's mainframe?
是圣诞老人的主机吗？

14:54.922 --> 14:57.818
<i>[hard rock music]</i>
<i>[硬摇滚音乐]</i>

14:57.887 --> 14:59.818
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

14:59.887 --> 15:01.887
No mainframe,
没有主机，

15:01.956 --> 15:04.094
just lame brains.
只是个蹩脚的大脑。

15:04.163 --> 15:07.542
Yo, where do you think
you're going?
哟，你觉得哪里
你要去吗？

15:07.611 --> 15:11.715
[high-pitched] Who, me?
I'm just a little elf!
[高声调] 谁，我？
我只是一个小精灵！

15:11.784 --> 15:15.749
[sniffs]
You don't smell like no elf.
[嗅嗅]
你闻起来不像精灵。

15:15.818 --> 15:20.266
Oh, yeah?
What's it to you, you moose?
哦，是吗？
你这驼鹿，关你什么事？

15:20.335 --> 15:22.025
[snorts]
[哼哼]

15:22.094 --> 15:25.128
Hey! Dasher, Dancer, Prancer,
嘿！冲刺者、舞者、舞者、

15:25.197 --> 15:28.749
Vixen, Comet, Cupid,
Donner, Blitzen!
泼妇、彗星、丘比特、
唐纳，闪电战！

15:28.818 --> 15:33.025
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

15:33.094 --> 15:36.715
Well, looks like we got
a whole Christmas special here.
嗯，看起来我们得到了
这里有整个圣诞节的特别节目。

15:36.784 --> 15:40.232
Ready for some reindeer games?
准备好玩一些驯鹿游戏了吗？

15:40.301 --> 15:42.991
Eh, peace on earth?
呃，地球和平吗？

15:43.059 --> 15:47.059
Whoa! Oof, oof, ow!
哇！噢，噢，噢！

15:47.128 --> 15:51.163
That better be mud
on your hooves.
最好是泥
在你的蹄子上。

15:51.232 --> 15:53.025
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

15:53.094 --> 15:56.335
[gasps] That's it!
[喘气]就是这样！

15:56.404 --> 15:59.887
Santa's Christmas tree.
圣诞老人的圣诞树。

15:59.956 --> 16:02.646
[both giggle]
[两人都咯咯笑]

16:02.715 --> 16:06.508
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

16:06.577 --> 16:10.163
There they are!
It's the trick-or-treaters!
他们在那里！
这就是“不给糖就捣蛋”的人！

16:10.232 --> 16:13.232
- Toy thieves!
- Christmas crooks!
- 玩具小偷！
- 圣诞骗子！

16:13.301 --> 16:16.059
Get 'em!
抓住他们！

16:16.128 --> 16:18.197
SpongeBob, what do we do?
海绵宝宝，我们该怎么办？

16:18.266 --> 16:19.577
Climb!
爬！

16:19.646 --> 16:21.887
They're going up the tree!
他们要上树了！

16:21.956 --> 16:24.266
Don't let 'em get away.
别让他们跑了。

16:24.335 --> 16:26.404
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

16:26.473 --> 16:28.922
We better check that alarm!
我们最好检查一下警报！

16:28.991 --> 16:33.439
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:33.508 --> 16:36.128
I wore you down, didn't I?
我让你疲惫不堪，不是吗？

16:36.197 --> 16:38.680
You meat head cari-boobs.
你这个肉头加勒比胸部。

16:38.749 --> 16:41.301
Toy thieves!
玩具小偷！

16:45.818 --> 16:47.508
Yo, elves!
哟，精灵们！

16:47.577 --> 16:49.956
What the Father Christmas
is going on here?
什么是圣诞老人
这是怎么回事？

16:50.025 --> 16:54.232
We got this under control.
Go back to your stables.
我们已经控制住了这一切。
回到你的马厩去吧。

16:58.059 --> 17:03.197
Oh!
Not cool elf bros.
哦！
不是很酷的精灵兄弟。

17:03.266 --> 17:06.025
Ow! Oof!
噢！钱币！

17:06.094 --> 17:07.680
[shouts]
[喊叫]

17:07.749 --> 17:09.059
Whoa!
哇！

17:09.128 --> 17:10.922
Hmm? Oof!
唔？钱币！

17:13.163 --> 17:15.439
[laughs]
[笑]

17:15.508 --> 17:18.922
Hey! Not funny.
嘿！不好笑。

17:22.335 --> 17:23.818
Ah!
啊!

17:23.887 --> 17:26.680
Whoa, whoa!
哇哦！

17:26.749 --> 17:28.128
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

17:28.197 --> 17:30.887
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

17:30.956 --> 17:32.439
Oh, no, Patrick.
哦，不，帕特里克。

17:32.508 --> 17:35.370
It looks like I have sowed
the seeds of discontent
看来我已经播种了
不满的种子

17:35.439 --> 17:37.439
in the house of Santa.
在圣诞老人的家里。

17:37.508 --> 17:39.059
Patrick? Huh?
帕特里克？啊？

17:39.128 --> 17:42.749
Candy cane... oh!
拐杖糖...哦！

17:42.818 --> 17:44.991
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:45.059 --> 17:46.922
Oh!
哦！

17:48.370 --> 17:51.715
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

17:54.818 --> 17:56.922
Oh! [groans]
哦！ [呻吟]

17:57.473 --> 18:01.818
[gasps] Santa's mainframe.
I found it!
[喘气]圣诞老人的主机。
我找到了！

18:01.887 --> 18:05.922
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:05.991 --> 18:08.542
Thanks to those two idiots
causing a distraction,
感谢那两个白痴
造成分心，

18:08.611 --> 18:13.646
I did it.
My name is the nice list.
我做到了。
我的名字是好名单。

18:13.715 --> 18:16.128
Now I just gotta be good
for the next few months.
现在我只需要做个好人
在接下来的几个月里。

18:16.197 --> 18:17.818
How hard could that be?
那有多难？

18:17.887 --> 18:19.956
He-he-he... wah!
嘿嘿嘿……哇！

18:20.025 --> 18:25.956
Oh! What the ho, ho, ho
is going on here?
哦！什么嗬嗬嗬
这是怎么回事？

18:26.025 --> 18:29.266
I was kicking back with
the Missus in the Caribbean
我正在反击
加勒比海的太太

18:29.335 --> 18:32.784
when my silent alarm went off.
当我的无声闹钟响起时。

18:32.853 --> 18:36.163
- [chuckles] Huh?
- Hi, Santa.
- [笑] 嗯？
- 嗨，圣诞老人。

18:36.232 --> 18:38.025
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

18:38.094 --> 18:40.404
Ho, ho, I should've known!
嗬嗬，我早该知道的！

18:40.473 --> 18:42.404
You're a menace.
你是一个威胁。

18:42.473 --> 18:47.404
[laughs]
[笑]

18:47.473 --> 18:49.404
All I wanted to do
was leave you this present
我想做的一切
给你留下了这个礼物

18:49.473 --> 18:51.404
that you didn't get
last Christmas.
你没有得到的
去年圣诞节。

18:51.473 --> 18:54.473
213 days late. Sorry!
晚了213天。对不起！

18:54.542 --> 18:56.818
A present is never too late.
礼物永远不会太晚。

18:56.887 --> 18:58.370
Oh, how sweet.
噢，多么甜蜜啊。

18:58.439 --> 19:01.163
Not even the elves or reindeer
get me presents.
甚至连精灵或驯鹿也没有
给我送礼物。

19:01.232 --> 19:03.577
- Um...
- Ah...
- 嗯...
- 啊...

19:04.473 --> 19:05.784
Thank you, SpongeBob.
谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

19:05.853 --> 19:09.784
Should I open it now?
- Uh-huh, uh-huh!
我现在应该打开它吗？
- 嗯嗯，嗯嗯！

19:12.991 --> 19:14.991
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

19:15.059 --> 19:17.680
It's one of a kind.
这是独一无二的。

19:17.749 --> 19:19.508
[gasps]
[喘气]

19:19.577 --> 19:22.508
The Krabby Patty secret formula?
蟹黄饼的秘密配方？

19:22.577 --> 19:25.611
He's giving it to Santa Claus!
他要把它送给圣诞老人！

19:25.680 --> 19:28.542
Forget the list,
the formula's right here.
忘记清单了，
公式就在这里。

19:28.611 --> 19:30.818
I could have it now!
我现在就可以拥有它！

19:30.887 --> 19:33.232
[laughing]
[笑]

19:33.301 --> 19:35.197
Huh?
啊？

19:35.266 --> 19:38.853
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

19:38.922 --> 19:40.335
Ah!
啊!

19:40.404 --> 19:42.301
Huh? Plankton?
啊？浮游生物？

19:42.370 --> 19:43.922
You're being naughty.
你很顽皮。

19:43.991 --> 19:47.473
Santa, I was born to be naughty.
圣诞老人，我生来就是淘气的。

19:47.542 --> 19:50.542
- Wha... hmm.
- Hmm.
- 什...嗯。
- 唔。

19:50.611 --> 19:53.232
Yeah. [chuckles]
是的。 [笑声]

19:53.301 --> 19:55.715
[mutters]
[嘀咕]

19:55.784 --> 19:57.680
Um, yeah...
嗯，是的...

19:57.749 --> 19:59.887
you can have this back.
你可以把这个拿回来。

19:59.956 --> 20:03.266
My bad, heh.
I mean, good... my good.
我的不好，呵呵。
我的意思是，好……我的好。

20:03.335 --> 20:05.335
I'm being nice, not naughty.
我性格很好，不淘气。

20:05.404 --> 20:07.439
Well, read it out loud.
好吧，大声读出来。

20:07.508 --> 20:09.887
Uh, that's okay.
呃，没关系。

20:09.956 --> 20:12.163
Go on, read it.
继续，读吧。

20:12.232 --> 20:14.818
all: Read it!
全体：读吧！

20:16.542 --> 20:18.508
"Dear Santa,
“亲爱的圣诞老人，

20:18.577 --> 20:20.301
"there isn't
a present big enough
“没有
足够大的礼物

20:20.370 --> 20:22.266
"to express how much joy
you've brought
”来表达多少喜悦
你带来了

20:22.335 --> 20:25.922
"to all the children and
sea creatures of the world.
“致所有的孩子们和
世界上的海洋生物。

20:25.991 --> 20:28.542
"So this is just
a simple thank you note.
“所以这只是
一封简单的感谢信。

20:28.611 --> 20:29.991
"Thank you.
“谢谢。

20:30.059 --> 20:34.197
Signed, with love,
your pal SpongeBob."
带着爱意签名，
你的朋友海绵宝宝。”

20:34.266 --> 20:37.163
[all cooing]
[全都咕咕叫]

20:37.232 --> 20:38.577
You got a typo here.
你这里有一个错字。

20:38.646 --> 20:41.611
Oh, how touching.
哦，多么感人啊。

20:41.680 --> 20:43.611
This is beautiful.
这很漂亮。

20:43.680 --> 20:45.404
Thank you, SpongeBob.
谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

20:45.473 --> 20:48.542
I wouldn't have made it here
without the help of Plankton.
我不会做到这里
没有浮游生物的帮助。

20:48.611 --> 20:50.577
He's really not that naughty.
他其实没那么调皮。

20:50.646 --> 20:53.370
And of course,
my best friend Patrick.
当然，
我最好的朋友帕特里克。

20:53.439 --> 20:54.646
Patrick?
帕特里克？

20:54.715 --> 20:57.784
Happy holidays to me!
祝我节日快乐！

20:57.853 --> 21:00.439
<i>narrator: The next Christmas.</i>
<i>旁白：下一个圣诞节。</i>

21:00.508 --> 21:02.749
Aww, here you go!
哇哦，给你！

21:02.818 --> 21:05.853
[chuckles]
Happy holidays, everybody.
[笑声]
大家节日快乐。

21:05.922 --> 21:08.094
Sheldon.
谢尔顿。

21:08.163 --> 21:09.887
Lump of coal.
煤块。

21:11.508 --> 21:13.439
Merry Christmas, Plankton.
圣诞快乐，浮游生物。

21:13.508 --> 21:15.853
Another lump of coal no doubt.
毫无疑问又是一块煤。

21:17.508 --> 21:19.370
What's this?
这是什么？

21:19.439 --> 21:21.922
"Merry Christmas to Plankton!
“祝浮游生物圣诞快乐！

21:21.991 --> 21:26.163
One day you will
destroy us all."
有一天你会
毁灭我们所有人。”

21:26.232 --> 21:28.749
Yes, I will, SpongeBob.
是的，我会的，海绵宝宝。

21:28.818 --> 21:33.542
Yes, I will. [cackles]
是的，我会。 [咯咯笑]

21:38.163 --> 21:40.508
Destroy!
破坏！

21:40.577 --> 21:41.956
[roars]
[怒吼]

21:42.025 --> 21:47.508
<i>Ho, ho, ho! [cackles]
[all screaming]</i>
<i>嗬，嗬，嗬！ [咯咯笑]
[全都尖叫]</i>

<i>嗬，嗬，嗬！ [咯咯笑]
[全都尖叫]</i>